OL,3,GNEWSAEducational psychology team
OL,4,Aworking with schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools in Jersey will have faster
OL,7,Faccess to specialist educational
OL,8,Fpsychology and wellbeing support, the
OL,9,Fgovernment has said.
OL,11,FIt follows recruitment for a full
OL,12,FEducational Psychology and Wellbeing
OL,13,FService (PAWBS) team which has allowed
OL,14,Feach school to have an allocated
OL,15,Fpsychologist.
OL,17,FMinister For Education Catherine Curtis
OL,18,Fsaid it was a "significant achievement"
OL,19,Fand would "make a real difference for
OL,20,Fchildren, families and staff".
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
